    "Solve for x: 4x - 9 = 2x + 11::x = 10|x = 1|x = -10|x = 20": "Subtract 2x from both sides to gather the x's: 2x minus 9 equals 11. Add 9 to both sides — 2x equals 20 — then divide by 2 to get x equals 10.",
