    "s1::According to Table 1, what was the average height of plants given Fertilizer B?::9.8 cm|12.4 cm|15.1 cm|17.3 cm": "Find Fertilizer B's row and read across to the height column — 15.1 centimeters on average.",
    "s1::According to Table 1, what was the average root mass for plants given Fertilizer D?::2.7 g|3.1 g|4.4 g|5.0 g": "Find Fertilizer D's row and read across to the root mass column — 5.0 grams on average.",
    "s2::According to Figure 1, what is the reaction rate at 50°C?::18 μmol/min|28 μmol/min|32 μmol/min|40 μmol/min": "Find 50°C in the figure — the reaction rate there is 32 micromoles per minute.",
