    "s4::According to Experiment 1, what was the average stem growth for Group 4 (white light)?::4.8 cm|11.5 cm|12.9 cm|14.2 cm": "Find Group 4, grown under white light, and read across to stem growth — 12.9 centimeters on average.",
    "s5::According to Table 2, which watering frequency produced the highest average yield?::1 time/week|3 times/week|5 times/week|7 times/week": "Scan the yield column for the highest value — that's Plot W3, watered 5 times a week, at 4.5 kilograms per plant.",
    "s5::According to Table 2, what was the average fruit size for Plot W2?::85 g|105 g|110 g|120 g": "Find Plot W2's row and read across to fruit size — 110 grams on average.",
